# Helm templates are Go templates, not YAML. Prettier parses them as YAML and
# fails on the first `{{- include ... }}`:
#   SyntaxError: Block collections are not allowed within flow collections
# There is nothing to fix in the file — the parser is simply the wrong one.
# `helm lint` and the render checks in CI are what validate these.
deploy/helm/*/templates/

# Generated from tokens.ts; a CI test fails if the two drift, so formatting it
# independently would create a diff that looks like drift.
packages/design/src/tokens.css

